* Security: if your Android key leaks, your website and iOS still work — you just rotate one key.
* Each platform has a different "proof of origin" Google can verify:
    * Web → HTTP referrer header
    * Android → app package name + SHA-1 signing certificate
    * iOS → app bundle ID
* You can't fake those across platforms, so one key per platform = tightest lockdown.
